  "context": "Practical Example:\r\n\r\n1- Grid of squarish cells.\r\n\r\n2- Use the \"Boundary\" component to make surfaces out of the cells.\r\n\r\n3- Get the center point of each cell using the \"Area\" component.\r\n\r\n4- Extract the XYZ information from the center points.\r\n\r\n5- Select only the ones with the Y = 15.\r\n\r\n7- Jitter the resultant List.\r\n\r\n6- Organize (sort) these ones from smallest to largest X value.\r\n\r\n7- Back to step 2, randomly cull 25 surfaces.\r\n\r\n8- Back to step 2, use a pattern to cull surfaces.\r\n\r\n9- Ba",
